{
  "scope": "Four independent 1280x720 Vulkan Forward+ offline Windows processes per variant, alternated cell/row/row/cell twice on one PC. Menu, sortie, opening dialogue, unit selection and first movement use viewport inputs. An autoload observes rendered frames and node attachment without substituting the shipping battle or navigation code. After first movement, each process rebuilds the original 48x40 terrain on 13 fresh GameMap nodes; the first verifies five navigation grids, base solids and dynamic blockers by hash and the other 12 contribute to the per-process median. Files, not system caches or other applications, are isolated.",
